# LOCAL project file, for coq-lsp / rocq-mcp INTERACTIVE mode only.
#
# Why this exists: the repo root has BOTH _CoqProject and dune-project, and
# coq-lsp prefers dune when it finds dune-project.  No dune stanza covers
# case_study/RiscvPmp, so under the dune workspace this subtree gets NO load
# path and every `From Katamaran Require Import ...` silently fails -- which
# surfaces as "The reference Valuation was not found in the current
# environment" on any rocq_start against a file here, and as a preamble that
# reports success while loading zero Katamaran libraries.
#
# coq-lsp's workspace detection stops at the FIRST directory (walking up from
# the source file) that holds a project file.  This file is that directory, and
# there is no dune-project here, so interactive mode uses these paths instead.
#
# Not used by the build: `make -f Makefile.coq` is generated from the ROOT
# _CoqProject and never reads this one.  Keep the two -Q/-R lines in sync with
# the root file's.
-Q ../.. Katamaran.RiscvPmp
-R ../../../../theories Katamaran
